{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"largish-sizy-queensnake","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\n\nPyPI serves 0.15.1. Main since v0.15.1 (48 commits) carries the implemented `agentic` plan-review engine (ADR 0123): `rebar review-plan --engine`, an optional `engine` parameter on the MCP `review_plan` and `review_plan_start` tools, an optional `engine` field on `plan_review_status` and on agentic plan-review attestations, and `[verify] plan_review_engine` as a permanent setting. It also carries several store, Bedrock and CLI fixes. The operator asked for a minor release of that work, cut per `docs/releasing.md`.\n\nVersion: **0.16.0**. The engine work adds user-visible features and agent-visible contract fields, so a minor bump is the matching SemVer step under `docs/api-stability.md` (0.x minors may carry new surface). The release candidate is origin/main `d6ba771aabac`, hand-checked on 2026-11-13 (7 functional checks and a wheel smoke test passed). The known `rebar --version` gap is tracked separately as `coltish-serious-kestrel` and is not part of this release.\n\n## Approach\n\nFollow `docs/releasing.md` §\"Release procedure\" steps 1–5:\n1. In a fresh worktree at origin/main: bump `pyproject.toml` `version`, and `server.json` top-level `version` and every `packages[].version`, to 0.16.0; `uv lock`; write `## [0.16.0] - 2026-11-13` in `CHANGELOG.md` with hand-curated Added/Fixed entries reconciled against `git log v0.15.1..HEAD`, a fresh empty `## [Unreleased]` above it, and the `[0.16.0]` compare-link footer; add a `docs/release-notes.md` section for the 0.16.0 engine contract changes; `make install` then `python scripts/gen_api_surface.py --update` (only `__version__` changes in `tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json`).\n2. `make verify`, then `python -m build && python -m twine check dist/*`; one commit with a `rebar-ticket:` trailer and `-s`; push to Gerrit with the session hashtag; Submit with `scripts/gerrit_safe_submit.py <n> --revision <sha>` at LLM-Review +1, Verified +1 and 0 unresolved comments.\n3. `gh workflow run release.yml --ref main -f version=0.16.0`.\n4. Approve the pending `pypi` deployment via `POST repos/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/$RUN/pending_deployments` with a JSON `--input` body (`environment_ids` integer array).\n5. Confirm every channel; trigger `gh workflow run autobump.yml --repo navapbc/homebrew-rebar` if the tap has not bumped.\n\n## Scope\n\n`pyproject.toml`, `server.json`, `uv.lock`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `docs/release-notes.md`, `tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json`. No `src/rebar` change.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Version bump commit landed on main through Gerrit (change number and merge SHA recorded in a comment); `make verify` passed locally before push; `release_guards.py version-lockstep` passes in the run's `authorize` job.\n- [ ] [non-codebase] `release.yml` run for 0.16.0 completes successfully (run id recorded).\n  provenance: environment=GitHub Actions navapbc/rebar; principal=release identity (gh CLI, RebarBotNava-operated session); privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh run view of the real workflow run\n- [ ] [non-codebase] PyPI: `curl -s https://pypi.org/pypi/nava-rebar/json` reports `info.version` 0.16.0.\n  provenance: environment=PyPI production (pypi.org); principal=anonymous public read; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — curl of the public JSON API that installers use\n- [ ] [non-codebase] GitHub Release: `gh release view v0.16.0 --repo navapbc/rebar` exists, marked Latest, with wheel and sdist attached.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub navapbc/rebar releases; principal=anonymous-equivalent gh API read; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh api repos/navapbc/rebar/releases/latest\n- [ ] [non-codebase] MCP Registry: `curl -s \"https://registry.modelcontextprotocol.io/v0/servers?search=io.github.navapbc/rebar\"` lists version 0.16.0.\n  provenance: environment=registry.modelcontextprotocol.io production; principal=anonymous public read; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — curl of the public v0 servers endpoint\n- [ ] [non-codebase] Homebrew: `Formula/rebar.rb` in `navapbc/homebrew-rebar` points at the 0.16.0 sdist (`gh api repos/navapbc/homebrew-rebar/contents/Formula/rebar.rb`).\n  provenance: environment=GitHub navapbc/homebrew-rebar main; principal=gh API read; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh api contents/Formula/rebar.rb plus the autobump run","id":"22bb-f4e4-eed3-41ae","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["release"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Release 0.16.0"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1794617056119492441,"uuid":"82cb1e30-d631-4820-bb17-c8880c7768b7"}